@RagDocuments.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5240

### List all ingested documents
GET {{RagDocuments.API_HostAddress}}/documents
Accept: application/json

###

### Ingest a document
POST {{RagDocuments.API_HostAddress}}/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Clean Architecture",
  "source": "Robert C. Martin, 2017",
  "contentType": "text/plain",
  "content": "The goal of software architecture is to minimize the human resources required to build and maintain the required system. Clean Architecture separates concerns into layers: Entities, Use Cases, Interface Adapters, and Frameworks & Drivers. Dependencies always point inward — outer layers depend on inner layers, never the reverse."
}

###

### Query documents with RAG
POST {{RagDocuments.API_HostAddress}}/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the main goal of software architecture?",
  "topK": 5
}

###
